BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sinatra Songbook - Summer concert
DTSTART:20260618T210000
DTEND:20260618T230000
UID:8361883@oslo-events-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Text from the organiser:\n\n  On Thursday 18 June at 21:00\, T
 he Sinatra Songbook invites you to an evening filled with big-city atmosph
 ere\, jazz and classic elegance at Herr Nilsen.\n\n  With crooner Ingar Kr
 istiansen at the forefront\, the starting point is the very best of Americ
 an vocal and swing jazz from the previous century. The experienced sextet 
 has created its own expression — playful\, personal and true to the trad
 ition.\n\n  The band consists of:\n\n  Ingar Kristiansen – vocals\n\n  H
 åvard Fossum – tenor sax\n\n  Eckhard Baur – trumpet\n\n  Magne Arnes
 en – piano\n\n  Stig Hvalryg – double bass\n\n  Torstein Ellingsen –
  drums\n\n  The musicians have backgrounds from both small and large jazz 
 ensembles\, and deliver a repertoire that ranges from iconic Sinatra numbe
 rs to rearranged classics from jazz’s golden age\, as well as the band
 ’s own songs — all presented with energy\, warmth and respect for the 
 tradition. The audience will experience an intimate live setting\, close c
 ontact with the musicians and a great atmosphere in the room.\n\n  In term
 s of style\, the evening offers everything from fiery swing to sensitive b
 allads\, always performed with drive and professionalism. The audience is 
 delighted not only by the music\, but also by the humour and the connectio
 n that develops between stage and audience.\n\n  The Sinatra Songbook has 
 filled clubs and concert halls across the country for 25 years\, and at He
 rr Nilsen they are guaranteed to be in their element. This is an evening f
 or anyone who wants an authentic jazz atmosphere\, skilled musicians — a
 nd a musical journey that both swings and moves the listener. This concert
  will be a warm and memorable start to the summer. Bring a friend. Dressin
 g up is encouraged. Secure your tickets today.\n\n  Over the course of its
  more than 25-year career\, the band has released three critically acclaim
 ed albums: The Sinatra Songbook\, Urban Breeze and Let There Be Love. Expe
 rience genuine vocal jazz of the highest class — a band rooted in tradit
 ion and constant renewal!
LOCATION:Herr Nilsen - Oslo
URL:https://www.visitoslo.com/en/whats-on/events/?tlp=8361883&name=The-Sin
 atra-Songbook--Summer-concert
END:VEVENT
